+# UI review: HUD and daily reward popup
+
+**Reviewed:** `UI/Hud.luau`, `UI/DailyReward.luau`, and `Main.client.luau`, read from code. No
+screenshots were taken. The review covers the state right after joining (popup open), the HUD after
+the popup closes, and the claim moment. It looks at a landscape phone first, then tablet, PC, and
+Xbox.
+
+**Player and moment:** players aged roughly 6-12 on a landscape phone, who have just joined and want
+to start building. PC and Xbox ship too, so every action needs a mouse, touch, and gamepad path.
+
+**Not checked from code, verify in the Device Emulator:** the real pixel positions next to Roblox's
+top bar and touch controls, how text renders at `PreferredTextSize` Largest, how the screens look
+on a 4K TV, and contrast against this game's actual skybox and terrain.
+
+### Evidence labels
+
+Each finding carries a label from our UI design guidelines. Labels are never upgraded.
+
+- `[study]`: controlled or peer-reviewed research
+- `[standard]`: Roblox docs, Xbox Accessibility Guidelines (XAG), WCAG
+- `[practitioner]`: design systems and community practice
+- `[inference]`: a conclusion drawn from the labeled facts
+- `[unverified]`: not confirmed
+
+The guidelines rank principles by priority (P1 = play comes first, P2 = young readers, P3 = thumb
+sizes, P4 = read the engine, P5 = every input, P6 = readability, P7 = consistency, P8 = feedback
+and motion, P9 = respect the player, P10 = measure). Findings cite them by number.
+
+### Severity scale
+
+| Severity | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| **Blocker** | Breaks a platform rule, or a whole group of players can't use the feature. Fix before the next release. |
+| **High** | Most players are hurt every session: play is blocked, text can't be read, or a control is hard to hit. |
+| **Medium** | Some players or some sessions are hurt, or the cost is real but small. |
+| **Low** | Polish, or something to fix while the file is already open. |
+
+---
+
+## Summary
+
+| # | Finding | Severity | Platforms |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Discord link in the HUD breaks Community Standards | Blocker | All |
+| 2 | Menu buttons are blank orange squares, and their names show only on hover | Blocker | Touch, Xbox |
