+| 9 | Popup text and buttons fail contrast | High | All |
+| 10 | `TextScaled` everywhere: ignores the player's text size, and the streak paragraph shrinks to tiny text | High | All |
+| 11 | Day tiles show state by color only and don't show the reward | Medium | All |
